WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,800
The largest crab is close to the cheeky duck

2
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,000
Only rare butter crabs are the same

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,200
But not bad

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,200
That butter crab looks like it weighs two pounds

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,980
It’s enough to sell for eight yuan

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,200
Uncle, I want to try it too

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:37,300
Go ahead and let me divide the remaining goods.

8
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,700
Pepepe, my phone stinks too much

9
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,300
If I had known earlier, I should have asked you, uncle, to do it.

10
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:44,700
Don't waste this earth dragon net.

11
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:45,700
Not to the point

12
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,100
If there is nothing in this net

13
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,100
Don't ask me to do it instead.

14
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:50,900
Even if it’s the Dragon King who comes to pull him, it won’t work.

15
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,300
Grandma is right

16
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,500
My brother-in-law is the person retained by the Dragon Prince

17
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,100
I don’t have the Dragon King to take care of me

18
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,220
It's definitely better to hold that set

19
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:01,520
Brother-in-law, you’d better do it

20
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,980
Okay, then you can divide the remaining goods.

21
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:13,490
This building is so light

22
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:14,890
I'm afraid there's no big stuff inside
